<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <title>Welcome to the TechNeural Newsletter! 🚀</title>
  <style>
    body {
      font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, sans-serif;
      background-color: #0b0716;
      color: #dfdbed;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
    }
    .wrapper {
      width: 100%;
      background-color: #0b0716;
      padding: 40px 0;
    }
    .container {
      max-width: 600px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      background-color: #120d24;
      border: 1px solid rgba(124, 58, 237, 0.2);
      border-radius: 16px;
      overflow: hidden;
      box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);
    }
    .header {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #7c3aed 0%, #c026d3 100%);
      padding: 44px 30px;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .header h1 {
      color: #ffffff;
      margin: 0;
      font-size: 26px;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    }
    .content {
      padding: 40px 30px;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }
    .content h2 {
      color: #ffffff;
      font-size: 20px;
      margin-top: 0;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
    }
    .content p {
      font-size: 15px;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
      color: #dfdbed;
    }
    .feature-list {
      background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
      border-radius: 12px;
      padding: 20px;
      margin-bottom: 28px;
      list-style-type: none;
      padding-left: 20px;
    }
    .feature-list li {
      position: relative;
      font-size: 14px;
      color: #dfdbed;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }
    .feature-list li:last-child {
      margin-bottom: 0;
    }
    .feature-list li::before {
      content: "✦";
      position: absolute;
      left: -18px;
      color: #7c3aed;
    }
    .footer {
      text-align: center;
      padding: 30px;
      border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
      font-size: 12px;
      color: #72629b;
    }
    .socials {
      margin-top: 16px;
    }
    .socials a {
      color: #7c3aed;
      text-decoration: none;
      margin: 0 10px;
      font-weight: 500;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="wrapper">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="header">
        <h1>You're on the list! 🚀</h1>
      </div>
      <div class="content">
        <h2>Hey there,</h2>
        <p>Thanks for subscribing to the TechNeural newsletter. We are thrilled to have you join our circle of founders, engineers, and builders.</p>
        <p>Every few weeks, we send out one highly-curated email sharing raw lessons from real-world digital builds. Here is what you can look forward to:</p>
        
        <ul class="feature-list">
          <li><strong>Engineering:</strong> Shaving seconds off loading speeds, modular architecture, and scalability checklists.</li>
          <li><strong>AI Automation:</strong> Practical ways to tie LLMs, custom chatbots, and databases into workflows.</li>
          <li><strong>Product Design:</strong> UI tricks and UX psychology details that turn attention into conversion.</li>
          <li><strong>Growth:</strong> Honest technical SEO tactics and organic traction strategies.</li>
        </ul>

        <p>We respect your inbox: zero fluff, zero sales-pitch spam. Just high-density notes from the workshop.</p>
        <p>Talk soon,<br><strong>The TechNeural Team</strong></p>
      </div>
      <div class="footer">
        &copy; <%= new Date().getFullYear() %> TechNeural. All rights reserved.<br>
        We build premium websites, AI automations, and growth workflows.
        <div class="socials">
          <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/107535474/" target="_blank">LinkedIn</a> &middot;
          <a href="https://www.instagram.com/the.techneural/" target="_blank">Instagram</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
